<title>UK: Telecom Corp of New Zealand sets 150 mln SFR bond.</title>
<headline>Telecom Corp of New Zealand sets 150 mln SFR bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TELECOM CORP OF NEW ZEALAND FINANCE LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  TELECOM CORP OF NEW ZEALAND LTD</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    27.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   14.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
